{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "180", "x": 0.8951488575183035, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03859439108533224, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 2: And for reading historical documents, apparently, but my mom is", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12334338960510077, "w": 0.8261670184810457, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "shocked by my awful spelling and the fact that my punctuation is really", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1436641300790535, "w": 0.8266845644478523, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "inconsistent. I think you can put that down to lack of practice.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.16398487055300617, "w": 0.6331137607660172, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 1: I expect so. Personally, I miss writing by hand. I hardly ever write", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.19424346276951368, "w": 0.8259279302887728, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "anything now. I remember my grandparents had such beautiful handwriting and it", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.21471252375881908, "w": 0.8260550612314908, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "was so individual. Nobody I know would be able to identify my handwriting now.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23503326423277177, "w": 0.8260582395050587, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "It's a shame.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.25550232522207716, "w": 0.13630531131548435, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 2: I know. I feel the same way. I used to write a diary by hand and now I", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.28579803528881537, "w": 0.8259042470244439, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "do that digitally. It just seems less effort to do it that way. So, it's not just a", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.306118775762768, "w": 0.825968325120572, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "problem.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3264394973760245, "w": 0.09498300033740963, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}